cff-version: 1.2.0
title: chamnan
message: >-
  If you use chamnan in work you publish, or cite a figure it reports, please cite it as
  below — and please cite the version, because several of its published numbers have been
  corrected downward after being measured properly.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: wasuplao
    affiliation: independent
repository-code: https://github.com/ArcticFox2029/chamnan
url: https://arcticfox2029.github.io/chamnan/
abstract: >-
  chamnan preserves a long-lived repository's engineering context — an architecture index,
  an impact map, session records, and the decisions behind them — as markdown committed
  beside the code, so an agent reads it at session start instead of rediscovering the same
  structure every time. Repository-local, Python standard library only, no network calls at
  runtime, no daemon.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - context-engineering
  - repository-memory
  - static-analysis
  - developer-tools
license: MIT
version: "1.15.0"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
